            "value": "Select an existing physical or virtual Mac display to mirror. This does not create or resize a display. Extend remains a separate mode."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 Mac 上已有的物理显示器或虚拟显示屏作为镜像来源；不会新建或调整显示器。“扩展屏”仍是独立功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
